      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "A private credit fund can only sell to accredited investors.",
          "from": 0,
          "durationInFrames": 130
        },
        {
          "text": "So today, every buyer uploads a passport, bank statements, and a net worth letter.",
          "from": 130,
          "durationInFrames": 177
        },
        {
          "text": "And the fund stores all of it.",
          "from": 307,
          "durationInFrames": 65
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "problem",
      "audio": "audio/problem.mp3",
      "seconds": 12.65,
      "durationInFrames": 380,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "That is a compliance cost on the way in, and a breach liability forever after.",
          "from": 0,
          "durationInFrames": 166
        },
        {
          "text": "They become custodians of a data set they never wanted,",
          "from": 166,
          "durationInFrames": 117
        },
        {
          "text": "just to answer one yes or no question.",
          "from": 282,
          "durationInFrames": 81
        }
