        {
          "text": "proven by a zero knowledge proof, never the net worth behind it.",
          "from": 190,
          "durationInFrames": 143
        },
        {
          "text": "And the mandate lives inside the enclave, so the agent cannot widen its own ceiling.",
          "from": 333,
          "durationInFrames": 188
        }
